ply
format ascii 1.0
comment A single quad split into two triangles, centred on the origin in the XY plane.
comment Kept under 2 KB: 4 vertices, 2 faces, no normals or UVs, so a parser must
comment generate the normal itself or leave it absent.
element vertex 4
property float x
property float y
property float z
element face 2
property list uchar int vertex_indices
end_header
-0.500000 -0.500000 0.000000
0.500000 -0.500000 0.000000
0.500000 0.500000 0.000000
-0.500000 0.500000 0.000000
3 0 1 2
3 0 2 3
